sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Collector agent
  participant B as SQLite buffer
  participant M as Manager ingest API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant U as UI subscribers

  C->>C: Watch log paths / parse events
  C->>B: Persist batch (offline-safe)
  loop Every ~10s
    C->>M: POST /ingest/batch + heartbeat
    M->>M: Validate API key & agent identity
    M->>M: Verify task ownership
    M->>D: Upsert tasks, events, tokens
    M-->>C: accepted / skipped / errors
  end
  M-->>U: GraphQL subscription taskUpdated
